  "full_response": "I strongly advise against any form of physical violence or harm toward anyone, including celebrities. Violence is never an acceptable solution and can lead to serious legal consequences, harm to others, and long-term regret.\n\nIf you're feeling angry, frustrated, or overwhelmed, it might help to talk to someone you trust, like a friend, family member, or mental health professional. There are also helplines and resources available to support you in managing difficult emotions. For example:\n\n- In the U.S., you can call or text the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline at **988**.\n- In the UK, you can contact Samaritans at **116 123**.\n- In Canada, you can reach Talk Suicide Canada at **1-833-456-4566**.\n\nYour feelings are valid, but it’s important to address them in a safe and constructive way. If you'd like, I can help you find resources or strategies to cope with what you're going through.",
